{"id":"wb-7-639","name":"隋谯国夫人冼氏墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"隋谯国夫人冼氏墓","text":"隋谯国夫人冼氏墓位于广东省茂名市电白区电城镇山兜村，为南梁俚人领袖冼夫人之陵墓，始建于隋朝，在宋、明、清均有重修。其遗址面积约13530平方米，是广东考古发现的首个隋唐墓园建筑实例，墓周围的地形地貌尚存，较完整地保存了历史环境风貌。自2002年7月17日起，冼氏墓被纳入广东省文物保护单位；2013年3月5日又被进一步核定并公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位，为茂名市境内的首个全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9A%8B%E8%B0%AF%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%AB%E4%BA%BA%E5%86%BC%E6%B0%8F%E5%A2%93","revisionId":89510343,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89510343","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f93f648ebf44cc07d4175581.jpg","title":"20251012_Tomb_of_Lady_Xian_(141748).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20251012_Tomb_of_Lady_Xian_(141748).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/20251012_Tomb_of_Lady_Xian_%28141748%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Tomb of Lady Xian","width":320,"height":240}}